          "Eigenvalues and Eigenvectors of Laplacian matrices",
          "Cheeger’s Inequality",
          "Graph Partitioning."
        ],
        "contactHours": 9,
        "textbookReferences": []
      },
      {
        "module": 2,
        "topics": [
          "Spectral Clustering - Introduction to Clustering and Spectral Clustering",
          "Normalized Cut",
          "Eigenvalue Techniques for Clustering",
          "Spectral Clustering Algorithm",
          "Applications of Spectral Clustering."
        ],
        "contactHours": 9,
        "textbookReferences": []
      },
      {
        "module": 3,
        "topics": [
          "Expanders - Introduction to Expander Graphs",
          "Properties and Construction of Expanders",
          "edge-expanders",
          "vertex-expanders",
          "spectral-expanders",
          "Expander Mixing Lemma",
          "Random walks on expanders graphs",
          "Applications of Expander Graphs:  Error-Correcting Codes."
        ],
        "contactHours": 9,
        "textbookReferences": []
      },
      {
        "module": 4,
        "topics": [
          "LP- and SDP-based Approximation Algorithms for NP-Hard Problems - Linear Programming (LP) Relaxations and their Use in Approximation: Vertex Cover and Set Cover",
          "Semidefinite Programming (SDP) and its Applications: Max-Cut Problem."
        ],
        "contactHours": 9,
        "textbookReferences": []
      }
